{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-38216","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42813","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-38217","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42814","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-42815","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-42816","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-42817","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-42818","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-42819","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-42820","text":" markdown file across all 20 projects becomes a page whose route *is* its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-42821","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-42822","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-38218","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42823","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-38219","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42824","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-42825","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-42826","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-42827","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-42828","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-42829","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-42830","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-38220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42831","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-42832","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-42833","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-42834","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-42835","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-38221","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42836","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-38222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42837","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42838","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-42839","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-42840","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-38223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42841","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-42842","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-42843","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-42844","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42845","text":" scans the repo (excluding "},{"id":"spn-42846","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-42847","text":", "},{"id":"spn-42848","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-42849","text":", "},{"id":"spn-42850","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-42851","text":", "},{"id":"spn-42852","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-42853","text":", etc.), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-42854","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-42855","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-42856","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-42857","text":" "},{"id":"spn-42858","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-42859","text":" file plus top-level READMEs. 223 docs / 20 projects. 2. "},{"id":"spn-42860","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-42861","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-42862","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42863","text":" parses the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-42864","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42865","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-42866","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-42867","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes. 3. "},{"id":"spn-42868","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-42869","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-42870","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-42871","text":" links that resolve to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build). 4. "},{"id":"spn-42872","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-42873","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-42874","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-42875","text":" is checked to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-38224","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42876","text":"The campus *is* Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-42877","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-42878","text":" idea; the pages *are* BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-38225","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42879","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-38226","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42880","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-42881","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-42882","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-38227","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42883","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-38228","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-38229","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42884","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-38230","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 223 real docs mirrored from 20 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 9 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-38231","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42885","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-38232","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42886","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-42887","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-42888","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-42889","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-42890","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-42891","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-38233","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38235","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42892","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-38236","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38238","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42893","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-42894","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-42895","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-42896","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-42897","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-38237","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-38239","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42898","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-42899","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-42900","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-38240","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-42901","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-38241","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38243","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42902","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42903","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-38242","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38245","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42904","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42905","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-38244","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38247","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42906","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42907","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-38246","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38249","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42908","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42909","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-38248","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38251","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42910","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-42911","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-42912","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-42913","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-38250","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38253","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42914","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-42915","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-42916","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-42917","text":", "},{"id":"spn-42918","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-42919","text":", "},{"id":"spn-42920","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-42921","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-38252","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-38255","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-42922","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42923","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-42924","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42925","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-42926","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-42927","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-38254","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera6dc7ttvtrviaqxt4aft7oji3kosf5ruma6unoym54sx2gxssbqdq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}